Zsh completion definition.
.TP
.I ~/.config/fish/completions/adin.fish
Fish completion definition.
.SH SECURITY NOTES
Treat analysis output as a clue, not proof. Do not use ADIN's classifications as the sole basis for incident-response conclusions. Never paste sensitive evidence into public issue reports.
